You can can even tell it to ‘run in the background’ and it will work on it and make a PR and tell you when the PR is ready for review.", "channel": "D051LNQSFGQ", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758835413.835939", "type": "message", "text": "Yeah its a game changer. AI is built in, it understands the full code base", "channel": "D051LNQSFGQ", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758835282.744719", "type": "message", "text": "Have you tried cursor yet?", "channel": "D051LNQSFGQ", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758835022.083779", "type": "message", "text": "What do you use as your IDE?", "channel": "D051LNQSFGQ", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758834743.032949", "type": "message", "text": "Why is the RewardVFXManager setting which level was last completed?", "channel": "D051LNQSFGQ", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758832599.886089", "type": "message", "text": "Ok Cool", "channel": "D051LNQSFGQ", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"}, {"ts": "1758741900.550579", "type": "message", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0003_SLACK_ID> can you add track item match too?", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID", "thread_ts": "1758741305.545019", "subtype": "thread_broadcast"}, {"ts": "1758643365.607149", "type": "message", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID> can you update the match3d required versions:
